##### 4. Mystery Guest (lines 144–145)

**Test:** `ImportOrders_FromCsv_ParsesCorrectly`

```csharp
File.ReadAllText(@"C:\TestData\orders.csv")
```

Hard-coded absolute Windows path to an external file. This test will fail on any machine that doesn't have `C:\TestData\orders.csv` — including Linux CI agents, teammate workstations, and containers.

**Fix — embed test data inline or as a resource:**

